<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 28.027 Daybreak</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Edith Strout, Lapidary Journal, July, 1975, p. 859</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="266">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="284">121 facets + 6 girdles</tspan>
